<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 5: </span>Overview of datasets used in the study. Attks is the number of attacks included in the dataset. A.Tokens is the average token length using the Falcon <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citenum"><a href="#bib.bib1" title="" class="ltx_ref">1</a></cite> tokenizer. A.Train, A.Val, and A.Test are the average train, validation, test set sizes across all domain splits. The train and validation datasets are class balanced. LLM stats for MAGE-OOD and domain stats for MAGE-OOLLM are not disclosed by the data authors.</figcaption>
